OL,3,GNEWSAVale Earth Fair celebrates 50
OL,4,Ayears of growth
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Channel Islands longest-running
OL,7,Fmusic festival the Vale Earth Fair is
OL,8,Fcelebrating its 50-year anniversary.
OL,10,FThe first event in 1976 involved local
OL,11,Fbands on a single stage inside the Vale
OL,12,FCastle in the north of Guernsey with
OL,13,Fpower for the stage and speakers
OL,14,Fneeding to be sourced from a nearby
OL,15,Fbusiness.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
