OL,3,GNEWSAVale Earth Fair celebrates 50
OL,4,Ayears of growth
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2026, organisers planned to have six
OL,7,Fstages around the castle site with
OL,8,Fbands from Jersey and the UK due to
OL,9,Fperform including headliner the Orb,
OL,10,Fbut due to forecast high winds the
OL,11,Fevent was moved to several indoor
OL,12,Fvenues.
OL,14,FThe Vale Earth Fair Collective - the
OL,15,Fgroup of volunteers that organise the
OL,16,Ffestival - promotes music and the arts
OL,17,Fin the islands through community
OL,18,Fevents.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
